  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12426b86-6d4e-400e-826a-307427760047"],
 ". The walks can be vertex lists or walk graphs; a list of chains of walk \
graphs is mapped over."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b3fa4f29-98b3-457d-b608-827985e76f7c"]
